ype":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Reproducible in latest master (after #97912)\r\n- Not reproducible e.g. in 4.4.dev4\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nGodot v4.4.dev (ec6a1c0e7) - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 01 Nov 2024 03:30:41 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1235U (12 threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nMultiplayerSpawner are broken now because internally they don't work with UIDs (#91084 didn't fix this), and after #97912 paths are stored as UIDs.\r\nRelated to: #90903\r\n![изображение](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6bdcc422-0928-4af3-a060-e9d79d427e7d)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Try to use MultiplayerSpawner in new project, or resave file with it in old project. If it remains from previous Godot versions, it will work.\r\n2. Notice no spawn happening.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[bomber.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17715885/bomber.zip)\r\n1. Resave world.tscn\r\n2. Run project.\r\n3. Notice no spawn happening.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gi